So if we architected
this correctly,

00:06:39.260 --> 00:06:42.320
this will have fired
off a Cloud Function.

00:06:42.320 --> 00:06:45.200
We can verify this by going
into our logs viewer here.

00:06:49.190 --> 00:06:51.650
And it'll take a
couple of seconds.

00:06:51.650 --> 00:06:54.350
But if everything goes well--

00:06:56.990 --> 00:06:58.190
there we go.

00:06:58.190 --> 00:07:00.480
This is the logs
for our functions.

00:07:00.480 --> 00:07:03.830
And if you're unfamiliar
with Cloud Functions,

00:07:03.830 --> 00:07:09.620
you can break down all of their
logs right here in Stackdriver

00:07:09.620 --> 00:07:11.460
to see what they're
doing at any given time.

00:07:11.460 --> 00:07:15.110
So what should have happened is
this fired off an API request

00:07:15.110 --> 00:07:17.360
to the Video Intelligence API.

00:07:17.360 --> 00:07:20.630
And I am intentionally
stalling, because I'm

00:07:20.630 --> 00:07:25.980
hoping when I go into Montage
Annotations-- yep, sweet.

00:07:25.980 --> 00:07:27.300
JSON's already there.

00:07:27.300 --> 00:07:36.295
So this is the transcription
data for our video.

00:07:36.295 --> 00:07:40.870
And you can see has the correct,
mostly correct sentence here.

00:07:40.870 --> 00:07:43.580
Start and end times.

00:07:43.580 --> 00:07:45.330
And I'm stalling again,
because I'm hoping

00:07:45.330 --> 00:07:47.540
by the time I go into here--

